      "location": "答33(e)阿贝尔差商极限末指数",
      "original": "(n-1)y^{n-1}",
      "final": "(n-1)y^{n-2}",
      "basis": "对(x+y)^(n−1)求x=0导数，结果为(n−1)y^(n−2)。n=3,y=3时左和与正确值6，原印18。n2…15逐递推、多个y整点验算。",
      "isAuthorOfficialErratum": false,
      "isProjectMathematicalCorrection": true,
      "cnPrintedPage": 662,
      "pageMarkdownSha256": "43193aa1734e9f5a330a47af9448ba5ecba02ac09b33ae74ad0fb1ea83b4f3a6"
    },
