      "cnPdfPage": 677,
      "enPdfPages": [
        807
      ],
      "location": "答36赋零次数渐近比的t取值域",
      "original": "对任意t≥1后一近似式不另限域",
      "final": "\\approx\\frac{(t-1)^{t-1}}{t^t-(t-1)^{t-1}},\\qquad t\\geq2.",
      "basis": "t=1时每阶恰一个一叉树，原比式分母为零。对n≥1，原精确式分子正好加n−1个1，故正文另列该值，保t≥1的算法推广。",
      "isAuthorOfficialErratum": false,
      "isProjectMathematicalCorrection": true,
      "cnPrintedPage": 662,
      "pageMarkdownSha256": "43193aa1734e9f5a330a47af9448ba5ecba02ac09b33ae74ad0fb1ea83b4f3a6"
    },
    {
