      "cnPdfPage": 678,
      "enPdfPages": [
        808
      ],
      "location": "答37的C_pq^(t)特例度数规格",
      "original": "n_0=(t-1)q+1",
      "final": "$n_0=q+1$、$n_t=p$",
      "basis": "对t≥1、p≥0和q≥(t−1)p，递推串A含p个t和q个0。恢复末0后度谱q+1个0和p个t，其余均0，根数q+1−(t−1)p。代入一般森林式恰还原答36。t=3,p=1,q=2时实际1，旧代数给3。",
      "isAuthorOfficialErratum": false,
      "isProjectMathematicalCorrection": true,
      "cnPrintedPage": 663,
      "pageMarkdownSha256": "8d0d2bf398b5cbe55c21123b3b8a7a4bae5d6be5a61476c4de587c8bea530679"
    },
    {
      "id": "volume4a-tail-tree-answer-004",
      "section": "7.2.1.6",
      "cnPdfPage": 678,
      "enPdfPages": [
        808
      ],
      "location": "答37子森林度谱移位的符号",
      "original": "\\boldsymbol f_j=\\boldsymbol e_j-(j-1)\\boldsymbol e_0",
      "final": "\\boldsymbol f_j=\\boldsymbol e_j+(j-1)\\boldsymbol e_0",
      "basis": "删度j的内结点并删j−1叶时，结点数和度数和同减j，根数保持。例n=(4,1,1),j=2时C(n)=15，正确移位给3，恰合紧接原下降幂比1/5；旧符号给5。含对应项的有限整式证据已登记。",
      "isAuthorOfficialErratum": false,
      "isProjectMathematicalCorrection": true,
      "cnPrintedPage": 663,
